<Document>

  <name>Cape Town Housing Ground</name>

  <description>Land screening for low-income housing, 30 precincts. Massing folder is extruded by storeys and carries the 2027-2037 delivery programme on the time slider. Redress folder is extruded by spatial-redress score. Criteria values are desktop estimates pending survey.</description>

  <Folder>

    <name>Massing and delivery programme (3D + time slider)</name>

    <open>1</open>

    <Placemark>

      <name>Founders Garden</name>

